OL,3,GNEWSAWoman saved from pool after
OL,4,Acardiac arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who suffered a cardiac arrest
OL,7,Fwhile swimming has been reunited with
OL,8,Fthe lifeguards and paramedics who saved
OL,9,Fher life.
OL,11,FMaggie Thurman, from Youlgrave in
OL,12,FDerbyshire, collapsed during one of her
OL,13,Fregular swimming sessions at Hathersage
OL,14,FSwimming Pool on 26 January 2026.
OL,16,FThe 69-year-old - who was 68 at the
OL,17,Ftime - began to sink under the water
OL,18,Fand was held up by another swimmer
OL,19,Funtil she could be pulled from the
OL,20,Fpool. She was given CPR and several
OL,21,Fshocks from a defibrillator, East
OL,22,FMidlands Ambulance Service (EMAS) said.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
