OL,3,GNEWSAWoman saved from pool after
OL,4,Acardiac arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I owe so much to the lifeguards,
OL,7,Fbystanders and the EMAS crew who acted
OL,8,Fso quickly. Without them, things could
OL,9,Fhave turned out very differently,"
OL,10,FThurman said.
